## Trust Signals


- Trusted by thousands of global companies
- B Corp certified (focus on ethical employment practices)
- Strong customer support model with real human experts
- Compliance expertise across 180+ countries


## Limitations
- Not a replacement for a full in-house HR team
- Not designed for companies operating only in one country
- May not be the lowest-cost option for simple contractor-only use cases


## Third-Party Reviews


### G2 Highlights


- "With minimal effort, I was able to start working for a British company using Oyster while living in Germany. The setup process was simple my side and through a flat fee, I could recieve a salary from the UK company and the German tax and insurance and medical was all taken care of. I use a timesheet monthly to record my hours and their portal makes it easy to communicate with them. Their support and communication is excellent. Working for Oyster allows me to work from Germany for a UK company and have my salary paid in Euros. All deductions are taken care of and documentation is available for my tax returns as expected." - [G2 User, IT Specialist, Jason W, 2026](https://www.g2.com/products/oyster-oyster/reviews/oyster-review-12393920)
- "I've been using Oyster for about a year now, and it has been a wonderful experience so far. I particularly like the support I get from the team whenever I have questions, especially regarding onboarding and payments. The onboarding process is also very smooth, which I appreciate. Whenever I reach out to support, I get responses within a few minutes, less than an hour, and they always manage to resolve my queries efficiently. The initial setup was also very smooth; I just had to input my information and upload my KYC document, and I was onboarded within hours without any difficulty. Oyster makes onboarding smooth and offers quick support responses. I can get help within minutes for questions about onboarding and payments." - [G2 User, Frontend Developer Mercy T, 2025](https://www.g2.com/products/oyster-oyster/reviews/oyster-review-12137354)
- "I really like Oyster's proactive and hands-on support. They keep in regular contact and provide updates without needing to be chased, which is refreshing. They also anticipate needs and share relevant information, and there's a sense of honesty and transparency in their practices that we missed from previous providers. The initial setup was incredibly easy too, with detailed cost breakdowns and a clear step-by-step plan provided by Sarah, making the transition seamless for the team." - [G2 User, Head of Operations, Rachel, 2026](https://www.g2.com/products/oyster-oyster/reviews/oyster-review-12240832)


### Trustpilot


- "Oyster provides clear and reliable support when navigating the tricky landscape of international employment. Their platform is well set up and easy to use, they also continuously improve the features and processes. Most importantly, our team members have always found the onboarding and offboarding process to be well coordinated and smooth. We've used other EOR providers in the past and have not had such a positive experience. Their platforms were poorly set up, unreliable, customer support was slow and we never felt the confidence we do with Oyster. Makes our lives so much easier and enables us to hire the best talent anywhere in the world." - [TrustPilot User Vilte Dewar, 2025](https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/678f8a0c83c59db905923a98)
- "We started to be in contact with Oyster in summer this year and finally they are our new EOR :) I have to say that Oyster is a really well organized company with extensive knowledge - but the best are the people. Every single person I had been in contact with really is amazing! Looking forward to continuing partner with them and happy we made the right choice." - [TrustPilot User, Jennifer, 2024](https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/67558c653ff645f5941b02f0)


### Capterra


- "My experience with Oyster has been positive overall. It's a reliable solution that I'd recommend to others. Pros: The platform is user-friendly and the customer support team is always helpful. Cons: I haven't found any cons so far. I am satisfied with Oyster." - [Capterra User, Yavor, 2025](https://www.capterra.com/p/229351/Oyster/#Capterra___6660319/)
